# PG Ease Owner Mobile App Environment Configuration
# ====================================================

# 1. LIVE URL MODE:
# Set this URL if you want the mobile app to load your hosted web application in real-time.
# Useful for instant updates without submitting a new binary to App Store / Google Play.
# Example production: CAPACITOR_SERVER_URL=https://owner.pgease.in
# Example local dev:  CAPACITOR_SERVER_URL=http://192.168.1.100:5173
CAPACITOR_SERVER_URL=

# 2. LOCAL BUNDLED MODE (DEFAULT FALLBACK):
# Leave CAPACITOR_SERVER_URL empty/commented out to package the web build (dist/)
# directly into the Android/iOS app binary for full offline-first functionality.
